    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": " Garrett O Bric Property Advisors are delighted to present this own door apartment situated in one of Brays most desirable settings just off the Killarney Road close to all the amenities and services Bray has to offer. The town centre and bustling Main Street are just minutes walk providing an array of shops, cafes and restaurants. The seaside town of Bray lies less than 20 kilometres south of Dublin City Centre and is home to excellent public transport links with a plethora of Dublin Bus Services providing access to the city and beyond teamed with DART and main line train services making the commute seamless. The town has something to offer all, the sea, town centre shopping and mountain walks virtually on your doorstep. \nThis is an extremely attractive home in a superb location and is sure to appeal to a broad range of purchaser from first time buyers to those wishing to trade down without compromise. This property benefits from light infused, fresh and exceptionally well proportioned accommodation with tasteful decor and flooring throughout. Upon entering apartment 4 you are greeted by a welcoming bright hallway leading to an impressive open plan living space that maximises natural light and enhances everyday living with this spacious room providing ample room living and dining room areas perfect for modern day living and entertaining. A fully fitted kitchen features bespoke cabinetry and high quality appliances. Two generous double bedrooms, the primary with ensuite and study plus a full bathroom complete the accommodation. This wonderful home is further enhanced by a sunny south facing balcony, a perfectly proportioned outside space for relaxation and al fresco dining. This is truly a superb apartment with a footprint extending to the same area as many three bed semi detached homes and with a location that is second to none offering peace and tranquillity yet only a stones throw from all amenities. Early viewing of this home is strongly advised to truly appreciate all it has to offer. \n\nFeatures Include\n\nWonderful Outdoor Space\nOwn Door Access \nSmall Exclusive Enclave \nAmple Surface Parking \nMinutes Walk From Town Centre \nExcellent Public Transport Links With Dublin Bus and DART Services \nWalking Distance of the Beach and Promenade \nSuper Energy Efficient B BER Rating \nExtensive Accommodation Extending to 86.08 square metres \nAlarm System \nGas Fired Central Heating \nDouble Glazed Windows \nSuper Storage Facilities \nGround Floor Location\nSunny South Facing Balcony off the Main Living Area \n\nAccommodation: \n\nThis wonderful apartment boasts own door access to a welcoming hallway with contemporary decor while laminate timber flooring creates a practical yet stylish statement. \n\nOpen Plan Living Dining and Kitchen \n3.5 x 7.5m \nThis super spacious room boasts plenty of room for designated cooking, dining and living room areas, the room is flooded with natural from an almost completely glazed wall with central French doors providing access to a wonderful private terrace with a sunny southerly orientation. The outlook is breathtaking overlooking the landscaped grounds with a wonderful sylvan backdrop creating a serene ambience. This is a truly tranquil space perfect for unwinding after a busy day or entertaining family and friends with plenty of space for a large dining table. \n\nKitchen Area \n2.6 x 2.6m \nThe kitchen is outstanding having been recently upgraded with an excellent range of Shaker style bespoke cabinets in contemporary grey adding a sense of calm and luxury, the classic style cabinets boasts an extensive use of glass maximising light and providing a great way to showcase glassware, china or decorative items. This kitchen is not only an attractive space but a practical one, ideal for creating culinary delights with high quality appliances including built in oven, ceramic hob with stainless steel extractor fan overhead plus integrated fridge freezer, a larder unit provides excellent storage. This wonderful kitchen is complete with tiled floor in large cream porcelain tiles reflecting the light while being easily maintained. \n\nPrimary Bedroom Suite\n5.22 x 4.09m \nSpacious primary suite is bright and airy with attractive laminate timber flooring reflecting the light perfectly. A range of his and hers built in wardrobes provides plenty of storage. Generous L shaped ensuite is home to a wc, wash hand basin and shower cubicle with Triton electric shower. \n\nStudy\n2.2 x 1.4m \nJust off the primary bedroom lies a room currently used as a study but could be transformed to provide a sumptuous dressing room. A walk in storage room here provides an abundance of storage. \n\nBedroom No 2\n3.2 x 3m \nWith bright spacious double bedroom boasts a picture window overlooking a tranquil sylvan setting. The room is complete with attractive laminate timber flooring at foot. \n\nBathroom\nSpacious bathroom with high quality sanitary ware in classic white including wc, wash hand basin and bath with shower over head with glazed screen door. The tasteful decor is complimented by classic tiling. \n\nOutside: \n\nThis wonderful home is set in landscaped grounds with ample secure parking, a short flight of steps lead to a private garden area in front. Off the main living space there is a super terrace boasting a sunny southerly aspect, the terrace provides ample space for a large dining table creating an outdoor dining room ideal for al fresco dining and entertaining. This peaceful setting is perfect for relaxation with a stunning sylvan outlook. \n\nPrice Euro 385,000\n\nEircode A98 Y963\n\nBER Rating B\nBer Number 106704810\n\nVideo Link: https://youtube.com/shorts/evBDVf0dCVo?si=397cc5Pj2mcDzWH4\n\nDisclaimer\nWhilst care has been taken in the preparation of this property listing, the information contained herein is provided for general guidance only and does not constitute any part of an offer or contract. All descriptions, dimensions, photographs, maps, floor plans, references to condition, and other details are provided in good faith but without responsibility. Measurements are approximate and any areas, boundaries, or outlines shown on maps or plans are for identification purposes only.\n\nProspective purchasers or tenants must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy and completeness of all information, including measurements, boundaries, fixtures, fittings, planning permissions, services, and condition, by inspection or other appropriate means.\n\nThe agent has not tested any apparatus, equipment, fixtures, fittings, or services and cannot warrant that these are in working order or fit for purpose.\n\nServices \nAll Mains Services "
      },
